            "bg_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#171717",
            "heading": "RWS Wool",
            "text": "<p>We prioritize RWS (Responsible Wool Standard) certified wool in most of our products.  RWS ensures humane treatment of sheep, promoting their well-being. RWS farms follow sustainable practices, reducing the environmental impact.</p>",
