            "text_color": "#171717",
            "heading": "Vegetable Tanned Leather",
            "text": "<p>We place a strong emphasis on using vegetable-tanned leather for all of our leather products. Vegetable-tanned leather is an eco-friendly choice. It's processed using natural plant-based tannins, reducing the use of harmful chemicals and minimizing the environmental impact.</p>",
